“This is madness!” cried Servius, staggering up and clutching his throat as if he already felt the noose tightening around it.

“There are secrets to the Tower that few know,” said Conan. “Anyway, I’d be a dog to leave Albiona to die for her loyalty to me. I may be a king without a kingdom, but I’m not a man without honor.”

